Z||000002||Eric||03-02-2001||12:36 AM||||Hey now, I happen to like Sam Posey.  I grew up watching him commentate at the Indy 500.  A ten year old kid can really relate to someone like Posey because he doesn't try to talk over your head.  He breaks everything down in the simplest philosophical explaination he can possible provide.  Paul Page is the other guy who was always there.  For those of you who have never seen a picture of the man, Paul Page is probably the closest human representation of an elf the world has ever known.  Now for some totally unrealated reason, he only commentates snowmobile races.  Damn, I miss those guys.<P>Derek Bell, Derek Daly, Sam Posey, and Alan Decantene make up the Speedvision Dream Team.||||reg||1
